 HISTORY                                                          8210 1451
 -------                                                          8210 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8210 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic          8210 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed    8210 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law      8210 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to         8210 1451
 produce File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=86  8210 1451
 and ZA=186 were used for U in UO2 (10% enriched).                8210 1451
